        "text": "A\n\nI would pull the switch. Five lives outweigh one, and the single worker's death is a consequence of diverting the threat rather than a new victim created by a direct act against an unwitting person. Still, it's a painful choice, and reasonable people weigh the moral difference between doing and allowing harm differently.",
